graph LR
    Start([User Query]) --> Reason

    Reason[REASON<br/>Analyze & Decide]
    Reason --> Action

    Action[ACTION<br/>Use Tool / Execute]
    Action --> Observation

    Observation[OBSERVATION<br/>Review & Save Results]
    Observation --> Decision

    Decision{Task Complete?}
    Decision -->|No| Reason
    Decision -->|Yes| Final([Final Answer])

    style Start fill:#4CAF50,color:#fff,stroke:#388E3C
    style Final fill:#2196F3,color:#fff,stroke:#1565C0
    style Reason fill:#FF9800,color:#fff,stroke:#E65100
    style Action fill:#9C27B0,color:#fff,stroke:#6A1B9A
    style Observation fill:#00BCD4,color:#fff,stroke:#00838F
    style Decision fill:#F44336,color:#fff,stroke:#B71C1C
